{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15725","headline":"送郑明府贬岭南 · 司空曙","name":"送郑明府贬岭南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青枫江色晚，楚客独伤春。\n共对一尊酒，相看万里人。\n猜嫌成谪宦，正直不防身。\n莫畏炎方久，年年雨露新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}